  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_long_time_no_see_to_man",
  "label": "The phrase 'long time no see' is mapped onto the man in cowboy attire.",
  "description": "The text 'long time no see' at the top of the image is juxtaposed with the visual of the man standing in front of the wagon. This creates an analogical mapping where the man is implicitly identified as the subject of the greeting 'long time no see'. The phrase implies a reconnection or reunion, but in this hateful context, it is used to frame the man as someone who has been 'seen' or 'reconnected' with in a derogatory manner, setting up the subsequent racial slur. The mapping is spatial and contextual: the text is positioned above the man, directly addressing him as the referent of the phrase.",
